From fa4d1196b3a9130b3e8621cf6ab405fc81676bd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:51:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] board: qualcomm: add Fairphone 3 / 3+

U-Boot runs from the boot partition, chainloaded by the stock LK. It
boots a standard boot method from eMMC or, like lk2nd, an image with
its own partition table in userdata. Volume Up stops booting and moves
the console to USB serial, Volume Down starts USB fastboot.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
